207-    Row 0's path span is in the rightmost cols (c_left[0] >= W-6, c_right[0] = W-1).
208-    Row H-1's path span is in the leftmost cols (c_left[H-1] = 0, c_right[H-1] <= 5).
209-    The band widens toward the middle and is 4-connected row-by-row.
210-
