212-    span [min(lobe_rows)-1, max(lobe_rows)+1] (inclusive), forming a single
213-    lobe that covers each marker's col-0 neighborhood. Outside that span,
214-    c_left gradients up at 2 cols/row. Baked into the parametric centerline
215-    so jitter/smoothing treat the lobe as part of the band's natural shape.
